  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Integral Ecology in the Amazon</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Amazon&#xed;a: Ecolog&#xed;a Integral 2025 - 2026 project seeks to strengthen the experiences of sustainability and the own commitments of the families and grassroots communities accompanied by the project, through the consolidation of capacities for dialogue with institutions, reinforcing the networks of collective action, and strengthening the mechanisms of governance and care of the common home.
The project continues to promote work with children and adolescents, seeking to make them key actors who multiply their knowledge and skills in the care of the common home and the knowledge and promotion of the rights of children and adolescents in their territories, according to their realities.</narrative>
  </description>
